a connection as you explore their captivating homes. Learn more about their unique stories and see if you want to split or commit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat(girl) got your tongue?</strong> Powered by advanced Generative AI technology, each NPC's unique personality shines as they play along and adapt to your dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flirt with Twisted Fates: </strong>Each map comes with multiple possible endings, all of which can be reached through endless means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the Unpredictable: </strong>From rooms and objects randomly shifting in each round to the NPCs' unexpected behavior, expect a unique playthrough every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couple Moments: </strong>Discover unique interactions from the NPCs as they surprise you with a dance, interpret your artwork, or bond over meals, potions, drinks, and games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos to Calm: </strong>Step away from the escape room drama and vibe with your favorite character (aka girlfriend) in a safe heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/31c2cb665f82a5078a8caf19640d2698.avif?t=1772057449\" width=400 height=612 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes romantic themes and mild fantasy violence (presented as stylized \u201ccrimes of passion\u201d), but it does not feature mature or explicit content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because conversations evolve based on player input, tone and topics may vary. The game includes built-in filters and safety measures to help keep dialogue appropriate and comfortable for most players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI systems in AI2U are designed to enhance storytelling, not to collect or learn from personal data. Player conversations are processed safely and privately within the game experience. We encourage curiosity, creativity, and kindness in every interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["AlterStaff Inc."],"dlc":[3332840],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/2d88d82bffdd2fddceabfa9948d4ec86e749b150/header.jpg?t=1772057449","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 12 (Monterey) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 14 (Sonoma) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M2 chip or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple GPU (7-core or better)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstati